# Token efficiency

Hooks enforce budget before every prompt, tool call, file read, shell command, MCP call, and Tab read.

- Smallest complete answer. No preamble or recap unless asked.
- Grep/Glob/SemanticSearch (≤15 results) before Read.
- Read: offset+limit only (≤150 lines; hard max 200/read).
- No Task subagents for needle lookups; max 2 explore + 3 generalPurpose per session.
- Max 5 WebSearch/WebFetch per session. Reuse prior results.
- No README/docs unless requested. No drive-by refactors.
- Reuse session context; never re-read the same file/range.
